Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.79,0:01:24.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我擦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.56,0:01:46.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.41,0:01:49.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.44,0:01:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.47,0:02:14.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:43.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有车  有车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car. Car.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.28,0:02:44.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-戴夫  托尼  他们是说在这儿吗  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dave? Tony? They said over here? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.05,0:03:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-伙计 告诉你 我听到枪声了 -我看到行尸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm telling you, man, I heard shots. - I saw roamers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.97,0:03:08.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-大概离这里两条街远  也许这附近还有更多  -情况紧急\N{\fnArial\fs30}- two streets over. Might be more around - It's hot.here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:09.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-咱得马上离开这儿  -戴夫  托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get out of here. - Dave! Tony!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.94,0:03:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  白痴  你想把它们都吸引过来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, you idiot!  You wanna attract 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.97,0:03:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟紧点  我们会找到他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stick close. We're gonna find 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.65,0:03:21.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  他说了要跟紧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, he said to stay close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.63,0:03:23.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.11,0:04:50.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.15,0:04:57.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会儿他们应该回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should've been back by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:51.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是被迫藏在某处\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. They just got holed up somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:54.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱明天一早就出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll... we'll head out first thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谢谢  -不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.92,0:06:00.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-给你  -谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Man. - Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  别沮丧  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, I want you to keep your head up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.71,0:06:06.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你老爸  他是最坚强的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old man, he's the toughest son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.82,0:06:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别在屋子里爆粗口\N{\fnArial\fs30}No cussing in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.21,0:06:11.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.19,0:06:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-洛莉  吃饭了  -她不在屋里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lori, dinner. - She's not in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.53,0:06:15.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.45,0:06:24.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔  你上次见到你妈妈是在什么时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl, when's the last time you saw your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-今天下午  -她担心瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This afternoon. - She was worried about Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并且让我帮忙看着卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}asked me to look in on Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.95,0:06:31.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她跟着他去了吗  -她没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She went after them? - She didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.48,0:06:34.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家别慌  应该就在这附近的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody panic. Gonna be around here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-它们为啥不离开  -是你你会离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why won't they leave? - Would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.10,0:07:08.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱不能继续在这待下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't sit here any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.65,0:07:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从后面出去  跑到车那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's head out the back and make a run to the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.35,0:07:20.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-发生什么了  -有行尸  我搞定它们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Roamers, I nailed 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.77,0:07:22.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不见了  但是车还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}They disappeared but their car's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.23,0:07:24.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找完了那些房子  这栋你们找完没\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cleared those buildings. You guys get this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.84,0:07:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没呢  -我也没\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Me neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.34,0:07:27.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱要找戴夫和托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for Dave and Tony
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你俩都没想过去酒吧里找下吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one checks the damn bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.41,0:07:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -有人把门锁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Someone pushed it shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.47,0:07:37.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's someone in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.38,0:07:39.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, is someone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:42.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有人  我们不想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, if someone's in there, we don't want no trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.01,0:07:44.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在找我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just looking for our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.71,0:07:46.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-咱怎么办  -把门撞开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do we do? - Bum rush the door?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们不知道里面有多少人  先冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't know how many are there. Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:50.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不想惹麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.92,0:07:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是在找我们的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just looking for our friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.43,0:07:54.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果有什么不妥  请告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If something happened, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.16,0:07:57.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方四周都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is crawling with corpses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:00.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们能帮我们逃脱  我们会很感激\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can help us not get killed, I'd appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:04.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老兄  你搞错了  这里面没人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you're bugging. I'm telling you nobody's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.70,0:08:07.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有人抓着门把手呢  如果里面有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone guard the door. If they're in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.03,0:08:09.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们肯定知道戴夫和托尼在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}they might know where Dave and Tony are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们逼我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They drew on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:28.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴夫和托尼都在里面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dave and Tony in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.33,0:08:30.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.32,0:08:37.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -他们杀了戴夫和托尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - They killed Dave and Tony.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:39.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧  伙计  咱走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.05,0:08:41.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不走  我才不要告诉简\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not leaving, I'm not telling Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.15,0:08:42.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要回去告诉大伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna go back and tell them
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.09,0:08:44.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴夫和托尼在一个酒吧里被俩混蛋枪杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Dave and Tony got shot by some assholes in a bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.54,0:08:46.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们的朋友逼我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends drew on us!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.81,0:08:48.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没选择的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave us no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.52,0:08:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都失去过很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure we've all lost enough people,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.00,0:08:56.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做过很多迫不得已的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}done things we wish we didn't have to,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.49,0:08:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在就是这种情况  你明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's like that now. You know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在咱就把这个揭过不提\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just chalk this up to what it was...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错误的地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.15,0:09:07.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,错误的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.53,0:09:12.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开这  快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get outta here! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.67,0:09:44.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们找不到洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't find Lori
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:47.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-其他人也没回来  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and the others aren't back yet either. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.54,0:09:49.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那蠢女人肯定是去找他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dumb bitch must've gone off looking for 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:52.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -是的  她让我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Yeah, she asked me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.96,0:09:55.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我告诉她我不想再当跑腿的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told her I was done being an errand boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.12,0:09:57.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你啥也没劝劝她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:16.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:18.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.37,0:10:21.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经失去了我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already lost my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.27,0:10:24.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也用不着我担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't my problem neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.38,0:10:32.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-她不在谷仓里  -我找遍了院子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's not at the barn. - I checked the yards.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.29,0:10:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那她在哪  -她说过让达里尔去镇上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, where is she? - She asked Daryl to go into town.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.71,0:10:38.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她肯定是自己去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've gone herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.25,0:10:43.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.95,0:10:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你知道这件事吗  -不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you know about this? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.98,0:10:49.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  她带了枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, just... Did she take a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:50.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.51,0:10:53.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不会让她自己一个人去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't let her go out there alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.29,0:11:18.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都清楚这样下去不会有好结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know this is not gonna end well!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.57,0:11:23.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对我们大家都没有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing in it for any of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.57,0:11:27.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们只要  只要退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys just... Just back off,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.13,0:11:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不会再有人受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}no one else gets hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.38,0:12:33.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格伦  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn! Glenn!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.28,0:12:47.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I'm all right. I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.77,0:13:33.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.92,0:13:48.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我拖住他们  你去掩护格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold 'em here. You cover Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.52,0:13:51.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看能不能到你车那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if you can make it to your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:53.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他  让他把车停在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him... tell him to pull up back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.76,0:13:56.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们跑过去  然后赶紧离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll run for it, get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.53,0:13:58.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想让我去掩护格伦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to cover Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.72,0:14:00.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没参加我们的射击训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}You missed all that gun training.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是学过现在就能派上用场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could've come in handy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.28,0:14:05.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以射击  我不想做罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I can shoot. I just don't like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.71,0:14:16.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克要你尽力跑到车那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick wants you to try for the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.87,0:14:23.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你尽力就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll try and succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.20,0:14:25.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我掩护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll cover you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.11,0:14:27.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个好计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.44,0:15:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么了  -他开了枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - He fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定打中了格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must've hit Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:23.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在垃圾箱后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's behind the dumpster.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.72,0:15:26.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像不动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't look like he's moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.71,0:15:33.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你中枪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.08,0:15:44.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你中枪了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hit?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.39,0:15:48.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.95,0:16:00.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  车就在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. The car's right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.14,0:16:01.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-好的  -我们就快要回去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - We're almost home.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.91,0:16:04.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没事吧  -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.26,0:16:12.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.32,0:16:15.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.58,0:16:19.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(史蒂夫大药房)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.94,0:16:21.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.19,0:16:22.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都是行尸  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roamers all over the place! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.95,0:16:24.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得离开这  -那西恩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We gotta get out of here! - What about Sean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.90,0:16:27.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他中弹了  我们走  这到处都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shot him. We gotta go. Roamers are everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.56,0:16:29.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们走吗  -跳下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're leaving? - Jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.57,0:16:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快跳下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, jump already.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.10,0:16:41.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那家伙没跳下来  -救命  帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dude didn't make it. - Help me! Help... help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotta go. I've gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.66,0:16:45.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-对不起  -不  别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry! - No no, don't leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:49.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮帮我  别走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.80,0:16:52.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-去叫赫谢尔  -帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help!- Get Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:56.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命  帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.35,0:16:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不  - 赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! No!- Her... Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.87,0:17:26.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel. Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是枪声把行尸引来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The gunfire must've attracted the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:36.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克呢  -他跑对面去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Rick? - He... he ran across.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.55,0:17:38.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能丢下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hell, we can't go without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.83,0:17:44.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们得走了  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to go now.- No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:46.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  -抱歉  我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shh!- I'm sorry, son. We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.11,0:17:48.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别丢下我  求你了  -我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No no, don't leave me please.- We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.49,0:17:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不行  -他刚才还冲我们开枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't.- He was just shooting at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.58,0:17:52.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他是个孩子  -求你们帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a kid.- Please help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:53.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方被行尸包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place is crawling with walkers!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.96,0:17:56.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们不能丢下他  -栏杆穿透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can't leave him! - The fence went clean through.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不可能直接把腿弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no way we can get the leg off in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.35,0:18:02.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴  别出声  要不我打死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up or I will shoot you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:03.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打死他没准是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That may be the answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.29,0:18:05.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得把肌肉扯开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna get that leg off
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.37,0:18:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能把腿弄出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}without tearing the muscle to shreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.02,0:18:09.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样他肯定跑不动了  还可能大出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He certainly can't run.He may bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.97,0:18:13.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  别出声了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.Sh-sh... shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.79,0:18:15.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-闭嘴  -也许我们应该打死他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up.- Maybe we should put him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.93,0:18:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想看到更多的杀戮了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't wanna see any more killing,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.68,0:18:20.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是把他活着留在这太残忍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this is cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:21.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能直接把腿弄出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't we just take the leg off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.37,0:18:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-斧头还在车里吗 -不  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That hatchet still in the car?- No no, don't... don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.67,0:18:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别砍掉我的腿  求你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't cut my leg off, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:30.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 求你们了  别砍我的腿 - 需要砍断骨头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, not my leg.- Will this cut through the bone?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:32.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得切断膝盖骨以下的韧带\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to sever the ligaments below the kneecap,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.88,0:18:34.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,胫骨上方的切口\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut above the tibia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.04,0:18:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会失去小腿部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to lose his lower leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.92,0:18:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  不要  -我们离开这之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, don't. No.- When we get clear of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.22,0:18:41.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要去找些火种  烧一下伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're gonna have to find some tinder, cauterize the wound
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:41.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,防止大出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he doesn't bleed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.82,0:18:43.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  没别的选择了  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30} All right, no choice. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.82,0:18:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  老天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God, oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.39,0:18:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -把那根棍子递给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No!- Hand me that stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.77,0:18:52.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-给你  -不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here.- No. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.25,0:18:56.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们  有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.37,0:19:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.23,0:19:07.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.49,0:19:10.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天  到处都是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh God.They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.81,0:19:15.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  你那怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, how we doing over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:18.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要搭把手  放轻松\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need more hands!Easy easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.21,0:19:22.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要  求你别别别砍掉我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't don't don't cut my leg off please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.38,0:19:29.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  我们得走了  我快没子弹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we gotta go!I'm almost out of ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.07,0:19:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没时间了  快点  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't have much time!Come on, we've gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.99,0:19:33.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拖不住他们了  赫谢尔  快动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hold 'em off!Hershel, do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.85,0:19:36.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点  赫谢尔  -没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Hershel!- There is no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.42,0:19:37.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.93,0:19:40.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢下我  求你们了  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me!Please! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.19,0:19:43.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别丢下我  求求你们  别丢下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me!Please! Please don't leave me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.27,0:20:00.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You all right?- I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:02.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有事  我看见车祸现场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not fine.I saw the wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.23,0:20:06.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me look at you. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.76,0:20:08.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.76,0:20:11.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我低头看地图  结果撞上了一个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looked down at the map and hit a Walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.13,0:20:13.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下次别乱走  就不需要看地图了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time stay put, you won't need a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.34,0:20:15.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  我必须带你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, I gotta get you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.58,0:20:17.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我们得找到瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we gotta find Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.07,0:20:21.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回来了  他们都回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's back.They're all back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.99,0:20:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.55,0:20:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-真的吗  -对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.19,0:20:30.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:06.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你在干什么  -天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.00,0:21:08.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeping an eye on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.16,0:21:10.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是好心眼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't you a peach?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会让你离开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna let you pull away.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.71,0:21:15.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经有了一席之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've earned your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.47,0:21:16.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你把管别人闲事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you spent half your time minding
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.88,0:21:19.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一半时间花在自己女儿身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}your daughter's business instead of sticking your nose
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.01,0:21:21.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她就不会死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in everybody else's, she'd still be alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:28.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着说  然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead and what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:33.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说快走  我不想看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean just go! I don't want you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.64,0:21:38.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真麻烦啊  娘们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a real piece of work, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:41.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你要\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, are you gonna make
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.64,0:21:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿我爹或像我爹的混蛋说事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}this about my daddy or some crap like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.00,0:21:45.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pfft! Man,you know Jack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.91,0:21:49.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怕了  你怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're afraid.You're afraid
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:52.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你独自一身  没有老公\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause you're all alone.You got no husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有闺女\N{\fnArial\fs30}no daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.97,0:21:55.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道自己该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what to do with yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:59.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不归我管  索菲亚不是我女儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't my problem!Sophia wasn't mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.11,0:22:03.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要做的就是看着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you had to do was keep an eye on her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.94,0:22:38.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  你没事吧  发生什么事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh my God, are you all right? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.36,0:22:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-出了意外  我没事  -她被袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was in an accident. I'm fine, I'm fine.- She was attacked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.52,0:22:42.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  瑞克在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really am.Where's Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.58,0:22:48.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们还没回来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not back?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.04,0:22:53.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.32,0:22:55.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得把你先带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I had to get you back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.47,0:23:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你这个混蛋  -洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You asshole.- Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.99,0:23:03.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他是我丈夫  -我会去找他  会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's my husband.- Lori, I will go after him. I will find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.83,0:23:05.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凡事有轻重缓急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Now look, first things first...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.67,0:23:07.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得  我得照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta...I gotta look after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.42,0:23:09.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得确保宝宝没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta make sure the baby's all right, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.10,0:23:13.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要生宝宝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're having a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.69,0:23:17.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么你没告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.27,0:23:33.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  来确保你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Let's make sure you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.53,0:23:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.42,0:23:57.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:03.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am so sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.54,0:24:06.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我离开的时候没有告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I left without telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.82,0:24:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.83,0:24:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.45,0:24:13.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸什么时候回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}When's dad getting back?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.52,0:24:18.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hope soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.59,0:24:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉他有宝宝的时候我也要在场\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna be there when you tell him about the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.01,0:24:24.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的  他已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, love, he already knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.18,0:24:28.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只是想找个好时机告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were just trying to find the right time to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.32,0:24:33.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,男孩还是女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a boy or a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.24,0:24:34.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,生出来才知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we won't know that until it's born.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.49,0:24:38.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我能摸得到到它吗  -得过一阵子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will I be able to feel it?- Not for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.15,0:24:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你肯定有很多问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have a lot of questions, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.52,0:24:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从没谈过心\N{\fnArial\fs30}We never had the talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.63,0:24:52.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大概是我们忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess we forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.80,0:24:56.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别看我  那是你爸的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look at me.That's your father's job.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.96,0:25:01.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是女孩  能叫她索菲亚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the baby's a girl,can we name her Sophia?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.73,0:25:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.20,0:25:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm sorry, bud.Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.37,0:25:15.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我以为你知道了  -卡尔哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you knew.- Big brother Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.47,0:25:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-很酷  对吧  -非常酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pretty cool, huh?- I say that's very cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.79,0:25:22.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,介意我和你妈妈聊会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ...you mind if I talk to your mom a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.41,0:25:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她休息会再聊呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a little later after she's had some rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.00,0:25:29.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  我必须把你带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, I had to get you back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.40,0:25:31.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则你不会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't have come otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.44,0:25:38.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样...\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.98,0:25:42.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说完如何  拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}how about you just hear me out, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.34,0:25:45.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.65,0:25:47.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  给我一点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.Give me a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.12,0:25:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.62,0:26:08.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  洛莉  我撒谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Lori, it was a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.00,0:26:11.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是个小谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was one little white lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:12.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我认为..\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think that...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.50,0:26:14.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认为你该想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you oughta be thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.00,0:26:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝平安无事是多么幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}how lucky we are that your baby's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.92,0:26:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法停止撒谎  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just can't stop lying, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.16,0:26:21.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么我丈夫平安回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is back safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.03,0:26:22.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么我丈夫死在医院里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is dead in some hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.60,0:26:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, when are you gonna...when are you gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.60,0:26:26.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么时候会停止这么对我\N{\fnArial\fs30}stop throwing that in my face, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.45,0:26:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时以为他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that he was...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.28,0:26:31.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,重点是\N{\fnArial\fs30}the point here, Lor,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.83,0:26:35.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不能总这样跑走\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that you cannot keep running off like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.26,0:26:36.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时在想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.80,0:26:38.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在想我们需要瑞克来保护大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking we needed Rick here to keep us safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.54,0:26:40.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  是我保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick? I keep you safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.46,0:26:42.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像你对奥蒂斯那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you did with Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.18,0:26:48.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那晚发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened that night?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.28,0:26:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那以后你就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been the same since.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.58,0:26:54.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想知道奥蒂斯发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what happened with Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.00,0:26:58.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥蒂斯的事是因为我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened with Otis happened because I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.63,0:27:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你和卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you and I love Carl. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.07,0:27:04.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和瑞克说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.18,0:27:14.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.54,0:27:21.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你告诉...你告诉他什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told...you told him what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.92,0:27:28.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是不是说你当时以为自己成了寡妇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell him that you thought you were a widow?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.00,0:27:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你伤心欲绝  世界末日要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That you were grieving and that the world was coming to an end?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:34.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说你需要安慰\N{\fnArial\fs30}That that you needed comforting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.35,0:27:36.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是告诉他那是个错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you tell him it was a mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.43,0:27:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  那不是真话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Lori, that ain't true.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.73,0:27:53.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们曾拥有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we had,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.61,0:27:55.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是真的 -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- it was real. - It was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.41,0:27:59.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们做了长久打算  是真的 洛莉 -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It was a long time coming. It was real, Lori.- It was not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.28,0:28:00.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有你  有我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you and it was me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.98,0:28:03.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有卡尔  都动了真感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Carl, and it was real.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.81,0:28:05.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那种感觉很好  不要说不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was right.Don't say it wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.51,0:28:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.28,0:28:12.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回忆一下当时的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just think about what you felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.09,0:28:15.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一下就可以  你的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}just for a second. What you Fe... what you felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.92,0:28:18.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时  我们周围的一切都在崩溃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything falling apart all around us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.29,0:28:21.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:24.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有那段时光最美好\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was a one good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.00,0:28:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这你心里也明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know it's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.00,0:29:02.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的情况怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.41,0:29:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脱水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dehydrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.38,0:29:09.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给她输液\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll set up an I.V.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.72,0:29:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔不在  我也只会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best I can do without Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.52,0:29:17.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.66,0:29:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.57,0:29:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用  要是我爸在这里就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah, I just wish my dad was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.27,0:29:35.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.98,0:29:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了她  你要坚强些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just need to be strong for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.91,0:29:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本来刚要和她说--\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just reminding her about...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.45,0:29:45.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 算了  不提也罢  - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Never mind. - No no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:49.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I... I'd love to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.00,0:29:53.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸要是听到这些  会背过气去\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad would die if he heard this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.69,0:29:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我上大学后第一年暑假回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first summer back from college,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.76,0:29:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开车到家后  丢下行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}I drove home, dumped my stuff off,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.80,0:30:00.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直冲到马棚里去骑马\N{\fnArial\fs30}went straight out to the stable for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.87,0:30:02.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家人刚从教堂回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}My family comes back from church
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.97,0:30:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝在楼上拽过我的东西就开始拆包\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Beth grabs my things and starts unpacking my stuff upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.01,0:30:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 好温馨  -嗯 然后这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's sweet. - Yeah, until this one here
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.14,0:30:10.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始乱翻我的背包\N{\fnArial\fs30}starts rifling through my backpack.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.00,0:30:12.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她发现一个小塑料盒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She finds this little plastic container
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.00,0:30:16.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,里面有些粉色和绿色的糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}with these pink and green candies inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.35,0:30:18.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不知道我一直在服药\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't even know I was on the pill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.99,0:30:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以她一想到我和男孩子  还有性  就吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was so freaked out by the idea of me, and boys and sex,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.53,0:30:26.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她跑到外面把那些药丢到了池塘里\N{\fnArial\fs30}she runs outside and Chucks them in the duck pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.06,0:30:29.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我骑马过去看到这些后气得大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I ride up, I see this, I'm screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.53,0:30:32.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她大哭起来  肖恩跑到外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's crying and Shawn runs outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.27,0:30:36.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为我们俩人之中有人溺水\N{\fnArial\fs30}thinks one of us is drowning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等查明事情原委之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon as he figures out what's going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.07,0:30:40.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那混球大笑一声  掉头就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}the jerk busts out laughing so loud
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.38,0:30:45.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我的马弄毛了  结果我们三个满身都是泥巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my horse rears up and gets mud all over the three of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.00,0:30:50.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸出来喊道  出了什么事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad comes out, "what the heck's goin' on out here?!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.50,0:30:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她转过头\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she turns around,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.50,0:30:58.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眨了眨眼说  爸爸  我们在游泳\N{\fnArial\fs30}bats her eyelids and says,"we're just swimming, daddy."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.50,0:31:07.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她的礼拜服上还全是泥巴和鼻涕呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In her Sunday dress,all covered in snot and mud.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.00,0:31:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克和格林会救回你的父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and Glenn will get your dad back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.54,0:31:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,格林是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.20,0:31:26.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.00,0:31:35.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们真要去冒险吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you wanna risk it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.00,0:31:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可能没法活着回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not make it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:39.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 没事的 - 要是肖恩领队\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll be fine. - And with Shane at the helm,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.97,0:31:42.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就没法放心  他损失过队友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't be too sure.He's lost people before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.31,0:31:45.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他救过我  你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's had my back.What are you insinuating?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.64,0:31:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不希望瑞克回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't want Rick back,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:50.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不希望赫谢尔回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.82,0:31:53.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要是不在  他就可以为所欲为\N{\fnArial\fs30}With them gone,he's got everything he wants
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.02,0:31:55.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人敢反抗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no one to tell him otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.52,0:31:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了这个团队的生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane has done more to keep this group alive
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.89,0:32:00.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩比任何人做的都多  包括瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}than anybody, including Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.29,0:32:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会连这也信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't possibly believe that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.00,0:32:05.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.80,0:32:14.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兄弟们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.81,0:32:41.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了  你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.00,0:32:57.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帕特里夏  收拾一下库房  准备动手术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patricia, prepare the shed for surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.35,0:33:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你受伤了吗 - 没有 你这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you hurt? - No, but what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.86,0:33:07.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 我出车祸了 -车祸 怎么搞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was in a car accident. - Accident? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.00,0:33:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我出去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.36,0:33:12.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她一个人溜了出去  是我带她回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snuck out on her own. Brought her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.04,0:33:13.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 你傻了吗  要是--\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you crazy? You could've...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.50,0:33:15.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 那边是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.81,0:33:18.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兰德尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Randall.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.56,0:33:34.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没法丢下他不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We couldn't just leave him behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.42,0:33:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则他会流血身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He would've bled out,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.19,0:33:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前提是如果他能活那么久的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he lived that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.43,0:33:40.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,城里越来越乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gotten bad in town.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该拿他怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.70,0:33:47.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽力去修复他的腓肠肌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I repaired his calf muscle as best I can,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.47,0:33:49.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过可能还是有神经损伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he'll probably have nerve damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.61,0:33:51.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他至少一周都站不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Won't be on his feet for at least a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.74,0:33:53.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等能下床后  给他个水壶\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he is, we give him a canteen,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.21,0:33:55.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他带到主干道上  让他自己走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}take him out to the main road, send him on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.75,0:33:58.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不等于把他送给行尸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that the same as leaving him for the walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.12,0:33:59.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为活下去  他至少可以搏一搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll have a fighting chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.78,0:34:01.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就让他一走了之吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just gonna let him go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.89,0:34:04.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他知道我们住处  - 他一路上都是蒙眼过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He knows where we are. - He was blindfolded the whole way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.62,0:34:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 他不会造成威胁 - 不会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's not a threat.- Not a threat. 
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.98,0:34:06.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们原本有多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many of them were there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.86,0:34:09.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干掉其中三人  拿一人当人质\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed three of t, zir men,you took one of them hostage,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.69,0:34:11.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就不会来找人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they just ain't gonna come looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.54,0:34:12.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们不管他的死活\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left him for dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.66,0:34:15.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,- 谁都不会找来 - 我们应该派人把守\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No one is looking. - We should still post a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.73,0:34:19.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他现在昏迷不醒  还要持续几小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's out cold right now, will be for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.34,0:34:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去给他拿些鲜花和糖果\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm gonna go get him some flowers and candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.54,0:34:26.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧啊  各位  我们又痴人说梦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this, folks... We back in fantasy land.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.41,0:34:29.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在谷仓的事  我们还没说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we haven't even dealt with what you did at my barn yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.14,0:34:31.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我一次把话说明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me make this perfectly clear, once and for all...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.68,0:34:35.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的农场  我本打算让你离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my farm.Now I wanted you gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.22,0:34:36.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说瑞克劝我不要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick talked me out of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.49,0:34:38.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这并不代表我非要听他劝\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that doesn't mean I have to like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.44,0:34:42.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以帮你我一个忙  闭上你的嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do us both a favor...Keep your mouth shut.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.45,0:34:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我们今天先别急着做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna do anything about it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.00,0:35:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先让大家平静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just cool off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.66,0:35:21.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.38,0:35:32.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.97,0:35:37.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你父亲今天救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad saved my life today.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.01,0:35:41.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而瑞克又救了我们两个的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Rick saved us both.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.48,0:35:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.92,0:35:47.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呆住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I froze.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.27,0:35:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当时有人朝你开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you were being shot at.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.26,0:35:50.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.25,0:35:55.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不必去证明什么  -我以前做过那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't have anything to prove.- All I've done,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.00,0:35:58.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在却...\N{\fnArial\fs30}then this... okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.26,0:36:03.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's because of what you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.03,0:36:06.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那句"我爱你"\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I love you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.61,0:36:08.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.93,0:36:11.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一发子弹击中了我身后的墙壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}A bullet hit the wall behind me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.99,0:36:13.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我想到你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I...I thought of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.39,0:36:16.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,失去我  伤心痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losing me, hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我无法承受  所以我躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I couldn't take it, so I hid
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.74,0:36:21.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就为了活命\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stay alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.92,0:36:26.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-格伦  -别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn.- No no no.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.83,0:36:28.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.09,0:36:32.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克和你父亲  他们依靠我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, your dad...They were counting on me
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.00,0:36:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我却只想着自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I...I only thought of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.55,0:37:08.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她吃东西了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has she eaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.28,0:37:13.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会给她点镇静剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give her a sedative...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.81,0:37:16.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让她身体不要过度消耗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop her body from working too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.76,0:37:21.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你跑去喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.52,0:37:24.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在可不是担心那个的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was the least of my worries.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.99,0:37:27.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你丢下我  让我不知所措\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left and I didn't know what to do!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.74,0:37:48.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要我放哨吗  -好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want me to take watch? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.95,0:37:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,换班制  几小时后我去墓地放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relieve T. In a few hours.I'm gonna take the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:54.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.83,0:37:57.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他开开心心的送走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just send him on his merry way?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.39,0:38:00.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克和赫谢尔是这么说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to Rick and Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.17,0:38:03.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他把他的人引到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he finds his people and leads them here,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.23,0:38:05.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间肯定会开战\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have a war on our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.13,0:38:07.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的我可比你要更清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know you're preaching to the choir, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.62,0:38:09.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有想过处事温和点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever consider a lighter touch?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.15,0:38:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放弃搜寻索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abandoning the search for Sophia,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.05,0:38:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀死谷仓僵尸  今天对洛莉撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking out the walkers in the barn, lying to Lori today...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.22,0:38:16.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的决定都没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were all the right calls.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.68,0:38:19.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你的表达方式让大家不满\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your presentation that leaves something to be desired.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.39,0:38:20.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔派你来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale send you?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.55,0:38:23.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现你在疏远所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you pushing everyone away.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.59,0:38:26.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何必呢  他们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what? They need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.20,0:38:29.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我永远都是多余的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh. I'll always be the odd man out...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.64,0:38:31.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-和你一样  -我已经心平气和了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The same as you. - I've made my peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.74,0:38:35.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  就我所见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you? The way I see it,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.46,0:38:38.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和我  我们遭受了同样的待遇\N{\fnArial\fs30}you and me, we... We're treated the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.46,0:38:42.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所有人都想拿走你的枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone's always trying to take the gun out of your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.40,0:38:44.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些家伙  他们想玩过家家\N{\fnArial\fs30}These folks... They want to play house.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.69,0:38:46.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想假装瑞克和赫谢尔...\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanna pretend that Rick and Hershel...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.51,0:38:48.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道自己在做什么  我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know what they're doing. Lemme tell you something...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.14,0:38:49.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一定会害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bound to get us all killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.14,0:38:51.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那我们必须阻止他们  -他们不会听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Then we have to stop that. - They don't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.19,0:38:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要给这孩子一个补给包\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna give this kid a care package.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.86,0:38:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要让他回去  你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna send him on his way. And you right,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.25,0:38:56.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这会带来一场大战或更糟的结局\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's gonna bring on a war or something worse,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.81,0:39:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我们只能坐着等死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we just gonna... we're gonna sit here and wait for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.54,0:39:02.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you and me, we...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.12,0:39:06.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是唯一预见到危险的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the only ones who see it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.91,0:39:10.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早知道我当初就和你一起离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've left with you when I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.56,0:39:21.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh man.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.09,0:39:25.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.55,0:39:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.62,0:39:39.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.58,0:39:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.28,0:39:50.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就像一对老夫老妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're like a couple of old people.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.44,0:40:02.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要谈谈肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to talk about Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.76,0:40:05.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他又做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's he done now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.60,0:40:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为孩子是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks the baby's his.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.06,0:40:19.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管怎样  肯定是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.07,0:40:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会接受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll accept that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须逼他接受  他不听我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to make him. He won't listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.98,0:40:35.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他胡思乱想还很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's delusional and he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.09,0:40:39.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我去找你的时候  他跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I went looking for you, he came after me...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.52,0:40:41.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他当然会跟着  -而且他撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, of course he did. - ...And lied to me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.63,0:40:44.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了把我带回来  他说你已经回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get me back here, said you were already back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.32,0:40:48.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到他在谷仓的所作所为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw what he did at the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.79,0:40:51.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在威胁戴尔和赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's threatened Dale and Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.15,0:40:53.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他吓到大家  他吓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's scaring people and he's scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.88,0:40:58.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我觉得他杀了奥蒂斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think he killed Otis.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.06,0:41:02.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得他把奥蒂斯丢下...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he left him behind and I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.48,0:41:07.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不只是为了救卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think he did it not just to save Carl
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.17,0:41:10.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-也是因为他爱我...  -你这只是推测\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but because he loves me... - But you don't know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.74,0:41:15.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为我和他才应该在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he thinks that we're supposed to be together
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.25,0:41:16.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.19,0:41:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些枪手今天丢下了那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those gunmen left that kid behind today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.64,0:41:32.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我亲手杀了两个人  为了保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I killed two people myself because of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.84,0:41:36.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔和未出生的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Carl and the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.14,0:41:39.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了他们我愿意做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was gonna be me and not them no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.78,0:41:48.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为了保护自己家人而杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed the living to protect what's yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.48,0:41:50.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.44,0:41:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩认为我是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane thinks I'm his.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.69,0:41:57.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他认为孩子是他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thinks the baby's his.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.51,0:42:01.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你没能力保护我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he says you can't protect us,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.15,0:42:04.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说你会害死我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're gonna get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.73,0:42:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他很危险  瑞克  而且他不会停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dangerous, Rick, and he won't stop.

